BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Manoeuvre node tests</h1>
A delta-glider in a 300 km Earth orbit. A prograde node of 100 m/s:
the predicted apoapsis is checked against the vis-viva equation; the
burn autopilot then flies it, and the trajectory predicted afterwards
must match the one predicted before.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/ManeuverTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-M
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-M
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-M:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6671000.0 0.00000 51.6 30.0 0.0 100.0 51982.6685767396
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
  NAVFREQ 0 0
END
END_SHIPS
